# Pin shell helpers to LF on every platform. The build jobs run on
# windows-latest with core.autocrlf=true, so without this a checkout there
# could hand bash a script whose lines end in CR. Git Bash tolerates a stray CR
# in some positions and not others, which is the worst kind of dependency to
# leave to chance -- so pin it rather than rely on that behaviour.
#
# Deliberately scoped to *.sh: a repo-wide `text=auto` would renormalize every
# tracked file on the next checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
